## Atlassian Document Format (ADF)

JIRA Cloud uses ADF for rich text fields like `description`, `environment`, and comments.

### Basic ADF Structure

```json
{
  "version": 1,
  "type": "doc",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hello world"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

